                "description": "Grandeur FAVHYD Fifth Avenue Plate Porcelain Hyde Park Knob - Designed to enhance any setting where a modern, sophisticated look is desired the Fifth Avenue Plate With Hyde Park Knob is both elegant and timeless. What is best about this door knob is that it will never go out of style--a simple classic, it will look beautiful for years, no matter how many times you change the room's decor around it. Glorified by over a century of history, the Fifth Avenue style is found in many of America's finest homes, offices and public buildings. The Fifth Avenue Plate's simple lines combined with the Ball Knob's classic style, draw attention to the stoutness created by its designers. This clean, classic design is a favorite in decorative door hardware. It will fit doors 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches with a 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset. Available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.",
